{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","number":66,"title":"Argumentieren: Standpunkte","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Ich vertrete den Standpunkt dass Homeoffice gut ist","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Kannst du das begründen","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Ja Meiner Ansicht nach sparen wir viel Zeit","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Stimmst du auch zu dass die Nachteile überwiegen","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Nein das stimme ich nicht zu","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Gut dann diskutieren wir weiter","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"der Standpunkt","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"der Standpunkt","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"begründen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"begründen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"zustimmen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"zustimmen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"die Ansicht","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"die Ansicht","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"überwiegen","voiceRole":"female","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"überwiegen","voiceRole":"male","pos":"verb","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Viele Experten vertreten die Ansicht dass Homeoffice produktiver macht Allerdings fehlt oft der persönliche Austausch Zudem betont eine aktuelle Studie dass viele Angestellte flexiblere Arbeitszeiten bevorzugen Aus meiner Sicht überwiegen die Vorteile sofern Unternehmen klare Regeln schaffen","authoredText":"Viele Experten vertreten die Ansicht, dass Homeoffice produktiver macht. Allerdings fehlt oft der persönliche Austausch. Zudem betont eine aktuelle Studie, dass viele Angestellte flexiblere Arbeitszeiten bevorzugen. Aus meiner Sicht überwiegen die Vorteile, sofern Unternehmen klare Regeln schaffen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Argumentativer Artikel über Homeoffice","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, meiner Meinung nach spart Homeoffice enorm viel Zeit — kein Pendeln mehr.","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Das stimmt zwar, aber dabei übersiehst du, dass viele zu Hause schlechter konzentriert arbeiten.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Ein fairer Punkt.","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Trotzdem überwiegen für mich die Vorteile.","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Vielleicht kommt es einfach auf die Person an.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, meiner Meinung nach spart Homeoffice enorm viel Zeit — kein Pendeln mehr.","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Das stimmt zwar, aber dabei übersiehst du, dass viele zu Hause schlechter konzentriert arbeiten.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Ein fairer Punkt. Trotzdem überwiegen für mich die Vorteile.","speaker":"Katrin","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Vielleicht kommt es einfach auf die Person an.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_066_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Das stimmt zwar, aber dabei übersiehst du die Ablenkung zu Hause.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Dein Kollege lobt Homeoffice wegen des Pendelns. Antworte.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Meiner Ansicht nach überwiegen die Vorteile, weil ich konzentrierter arbeite.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Er fragt nach deiner Ansicht zum Homeoffice.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Da stimme ich dir zu, so sehe ich das auch.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Eine Kollegin stimmt dir zu. Bestätige sie.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Ich begründe das mit den Zahlen aus dem letzten Quartal.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Deine Chefin fragt, wie du deinen Standpunkt begründest.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Ich bin dafür, weil wir Zeit sparen. — Ich sehe das anders, mir fehlt der Kontakt.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-66-argumentieren-standpunkte","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr diskutiert Homeoffice im Team.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":6,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":5,"vword-voice-M":5,"vword-listen":5,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Standpunkte","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":2,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Ansichten","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":2,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Viele","from":"reading","type":"Adjec